WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Choose a connection for your assistant.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Connect a model service. Here: local Magpie.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose an available model, then introduce your assistant.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Give your assistant a name and a simple introduction.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Attach fictional notes and ask for a weekend checklist.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The actual model organizes the details from the attachment.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Ask the assistant to save the checklist as a file.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Your Markdown checklist is saved in Notebook.

